          <tr class="border-b border-slate-100"><td class="p-3 font-bold">KC (Corea)</td><td class="p-3 text-center">4-6 sem</td><td class="p-3 text-center">2-3 sem</td><td class="p-3 text-center">40-50%</td></tr>
